:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Como tantas vezes acontece nos melhores projetos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Não foi apenas recuperar um carro.<br>Foi recuperar um tempo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Duas gerações. O mesmo volante.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Há um momento simbólico em qualquer restauro.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>O momento em que se percebe que aquilo já não é apenas um projeto.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>É memória viva.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Neste caso, o volante diz tudo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>O mesmo volante.<br>Duas gerações.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>O Pai que o segurou durante anos.<br>O Filho que agora lhe devolve vida.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Há gestos que não se explicam.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sentem-se.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mais do que um restauro mecânico</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Este <strong>Peugeot 104</strong> não está apenas a ser reparado.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Está a ser continuado.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Porque alguns carros não se restauram.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Continuam.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Continuam nas mãos.<br>Continuam nas memórias.<br>Continuam nas histórias que ainda estão por contar.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Entre ferramentas, silêncio e dedicação, este carro voltou a unir gerações.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E isso é algo que nenhum manual ensina.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">O verdadeiro significado deste Peugeot 104</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Não é um carro raro.<br>Não é um carro exótico.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mas é um carro com história.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E isso vale mais do que qualquer catálogo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Porque no fim, os carros que ficam não são os mais caros.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>São os mais importantes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Os que carregam pessoas.<br>Momentos.<br>Vidas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Alguns carros não se restauram. Continuam.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>O <strong>Peugeot 104 do Francisco e do Tiago Jacob</strong> é um exemplo claro disso.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Uma história que atravessa gerações.<br>Um carro que nunca foi abandonado.<br>Uma memória que recusou desaparecer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E talvez, algures numa garagem, exista outro carro assim.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Parado.<br>Mas à espera.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>À espera de alguém que decida continuar...</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Peugeot 104: Duas gerações o mesmo volante.','','inherit','closed','closed','','428-revision-v1','','','2026-04-14 14:15:58','2026-04-14 14:15:58','',428,'http://35.188.192.145/?p=430',0,'revision','',0),(431,2,'2026-04-14 14:21:02','2026-04-14 14:21:02','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are cars that stop.<br>There are stories that don’t.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rust isn’t always what stops them.<br>Sometimes, it’s life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Responsibilities.<br>Silence.<br>Moments that force dreams to be put on hold.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That’s what happened to this Peugeot 104.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It stopped because life happened.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For years, it stayed there. Still.<br>But never forgotten.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>A car that never left the family</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This Peugeot 104 was part of Francisco Jacob’s life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>More than just transportation, it was a silent witness to ordinary days and special moments. The kind that aren’t photographed, but remain forever.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It was a family car.<br>A car of stories.<br>A car of life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With time, it stopped running.<br>But it never stopped meaning something.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And growing up beside it was Tiago.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The son.<br>The next generation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The moment everything changed</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some decisions seem small.<br>But they change everything.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Years after the car had stopped, Tiago did what many think about — but few actually do.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He decided to continue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not out of obligation.<br>But out of respect.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Respect for his father’s story.<br>For the car that shaped his childhood.<br>For what that Peugeot 104 represented.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It wasn’t a technical decision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It was emotional.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The restoration began where everything had stopped</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No rush.<br>No spectacle.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With simple tools.<br>With silence.<br>With dedication.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The restoration began right there, in the same place where the car had been left.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And more than parts and mechanics, a connection began to be rebuilt.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Father and son.<br>Side by side.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As so often happens in the best projects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It wasn’t just about restoring a car.<br>It was about restoring time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Two generations. The same steering wheel.</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There is always a symbolic moment in every restoration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The moment when you realize this is no longer just a project.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It becomes living memory.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this case, the steering wheel says it all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The same steering wheel.<br>Two generations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The father who held it for years.<br>The son now bringing it back to life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some gestures cannot be explained.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>They are felt.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>More than a mechanical restoration</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This Peugeot 104 is not simply being repaired.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is being continued.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because some cars aren’t restored.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>They continue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>They continue in hands.<br>They continue in memories.<br>They continue in stories still waiting to be told.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Between tools, silence and dedication, this car brought generations together once again.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And that’s something no manual can teach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The true meaning of this Peugeot 104</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s not a rare car.<br>It’s not an exotic car.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But it is a car with history.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And that matters more than any catalog.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because in the end, the cars that stay are not the most expensive ones.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>They are the most important ones.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The ones that carry people.<br>Moments.<br>Lives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Some cars aren’t restored. They continue.</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Peugeot 104 of Francisco and Tiago Jacob is a clear example of that.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A story that crosses generations.<br>A car that was never abandoned.<br>A memory that refused to disappear.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And maybe, somewhere in a garage, there is another car like this.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stopped.<br>But waiting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Waiting for someone to decide to continue...</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Peugeot 104: Two generations. The same steering wheel.','','publish','open','open','','peugeot-104-two-generations-the-same-steering-wheel','','','2026-04-14 14:35:10','2026-0