n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A escolha da nova cor</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Durante o processo, surgiu uma decisão inevitável.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Manter a cor original… ou mudar?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dentro dos tons amarelos disponíveis na Toyota na época, foi escolhido um tom diferente do que o carro tinha originalmente. Um amarelo mais esverdeado, com mais presença.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Foi uma escolha pensada.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E acabou por dar ao Corolla uma identidade própria.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hoje, é impossível não reparar nele. A cor tornou-se uma espécie de assinatura visual — algo que faz com que toda a gente saiba que aquele carro está por perto.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mas, no fundo, a cor é apenas um detalhe.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>O que realmente importa é tudo o que aconteceu antes dela.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Um carro que ficou</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hoje, este Toyota Corolla de 1974 não é apenas um clássico recuperado.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>É um carro que atravessou gerações. Um carro que esteve presente em diferentes fases da vida da mesma família.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mas acima de tudo, é um carro que foi recuperado com tempo, dedicação e ligação entre <strong>Pai e Filho</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E isso muda tudo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Porque há carros que se vendem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E há carros que ficam.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Este é daqueles que ficam.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Não por causa do valor que possa ter no mercado.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mas por causa da história que continua a viver dentro dele. sempre.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Um carro que sempre fez parte da família.','','inherit','closed','closed','','485-revision-v1','','','2026-04-18 14:29:02','2026-04-18 14:29:02','',485,'http://35.188.192.145/?p=487',0,'revision','',0),(488,2,'2026-04-18 14:41:04','2026-04-18 14:41:04','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The story of João Festas’ 1974 Toyota Corolla</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There is a question that almost always comes up when this Corolla arrives at a gathering or parks somewhere visible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Is this yellow the original color?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most people think it is. The color is bold, striking, impossible to ignore. But the truth is, it wasn’t always like this.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>It wasn’t always yellow.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And in many ways, that change of color marked the beginning of a story that goes far beyond a simple restoration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/SPtzni6wt8U\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-9-16 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-9-16 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/shorts/SPtzni6wt8U\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before becoming a classic, it was simply a car</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For many years, this Toyota Corolla was just a normal car.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No closed garage. No protective covers. It was used every day, like any other family car. It was part of daily routines, short trips and the small journeys that make up everyday life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It was bought brand new in 1974 by the <strong>Uncle of the current owner, João Festas</strong>. For decades, it remained within the same family, passing from generation to generation and always staying close.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But time began to leave its marks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Corrosion appeared slowly. First in small spots, then in more visible areas. Mechanical problems also began to show — the kind that come naturally with age and years of use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There came a time when it stopped being the daily car.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But it never stopped being the family car.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When it reached João’s hands</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By the time the Corolla reached João, it was no longer in the best condition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It wasn’t a car ready to drive with confidence. It was tired, worn, showing clear signs of aging after many years on the road.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That was when the most important figure in this story stepped in.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The Father.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A bodywork professional by trade, used to working with metal and car panels, he looked at the car and realized there was still hope. It wouldn’t be easy, and it wouldn’t be quick — but it was possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And he decided to move forward.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not as a professional job.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But as a project between <strong>Father and Son</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A restoration done with time</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There was no rush.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The restoration was carried out gradually, with time and dedication. Every part of the car was dismantled, inspected and carefully restored by someone who understood that this was more than just material value.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It carried emotional value.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>More than restoring a car, they were restoring part of the family’s history.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The garage became a workspace, but also a place of connection. Hours spent side by side, surrounded by tools, metal and decisions taken calmly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Corolla stopped being just a car waiting to be repaired.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It became a shared project.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Choosing the new color</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During the process, an inevitable decision had to be made.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keep the original color… or change it?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Among the yellow tones available from Toyota at the time, they chose a shade different from the original one. A greener yellow, with stronger presence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It was a thoughtful decision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And it ended up giving the Corolla its own identity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today, it is impossible not to notice it. The color became a kind of signature — something that lets people know that this particular car is nearby.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But in truth, color is only a detail.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What really matters is everything that happened before it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A car that stayed</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today, this 1974 Toyota Corolla is not just a restored classic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is a car that crossed generations. A car that lived through different stages of the same family’s life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But above all, it is a car restored with time, dedication and the bond between <strong>Father and Son</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And that changes everything.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because some cars are sold.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And some cars stay.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is one of those that stay.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not because of its market value.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But because of the story that continues to live within it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','A Car that has always been part of the family.','','publish','open','open','','a-car-that-has-always-been-part-of-the-family','','','2026-04-18 14:45:27','2026-04-18 14:45:27','',0,'http://35.188.192.145/?p=488',0,'post','',0),(489,2,'2026-04-18 14:33:03','2026-04-18 14:33:03','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The story of João Festas’ 1974 Toyota Corolla</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There is a question that almost always comes up when this Corolla arrives at a gathering or parks somewhere visible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Is this yellow the original color?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most people think it is. The color is bold, striking, impossible to ignore. But the truth is, it wasn’t always like this.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>It wasn’t always yellow.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And in many ways, that change of color marked the beginning of a story that goes far beyond a simple restoration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Watch this story told in João’s own words</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><math><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pla